            "body": "I've repeated the test using as little config as possible and I still get the same issue.\n\nMy `init.lua`\n\n```\nvim.pack.add({\n    { src = \"https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.clue\", }\n})\n\nrequire(\"mini.clue\").setup({})\n\nvim.o.expandtab = true\n```\n\nThis is run using a totally different set of folders:\n\n```\nXDG_CONFIG_HOME=~/.config/nvim-mini/ XDG_DATA_HOME=~/.local/share/nvim-mini/ XDG_STATE_HOME=~/.local/state/nvim-mini nvim\n```",
